          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Percentage remaining}&=100\\%-18\\%=82\\%\\\\\\text{Discounted price}&=240\\times0.82\\\\\\text{Discounted price}&=\\$196.80\\end{align*}$$",
